<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy information for visitors to PurpleTheta."><section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Website information</p><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p>A basic privacy page is included as a starting point. Review and update it before launch to reflect the services and data practices actually used.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap content-wrap prose"><h2>Information you provide</h2><p>If you contact us using a form or email, you may provide information such as your name, email address and message. This information should only be used to respond to your enquiry.</p><h2>External services</h2><p>This website may link to services such as YouTube, Google Play Books and Amazon. When you visit those websites, their own privacy policies and terms apply.</p><h2>Analytics and cookies</h2><p>Analytics or other tracking tools may be added in the future. This page should be updated to disclose any such tools before they are enabled.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For privacy-related questions, use the contact information provided on the Contact page.</p><p><em>Website owner: Please customize this policy to your actual practices before publishing.</em></p></div></section></BaseLayout>
